{"node_id": "real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021_15_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0004"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0004_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "We look at the neurons and\ncompare them to regular neurons\nfrom other parts of the brain. This\nhas allowed us to ask questions\nabout what's happening in the\nfundamental biology of the brain\nduring a seizure. We think seizures\nmay develop from disruptions in\nmetabolism and inflammation.", "semantic_text": "We look at the neurons and compare them to regular neurons from other parts of the brain. This has allowed us to ask questions about what's happening in the fundamental biology of the brain during a seizure. We think seizures may develop from disruptions in metabolism and inflammation.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0004_geometry", "bbox": [99, 780, 405, 1005], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0004"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_74/hybrid/real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021/page_0015/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021_15_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0006"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0006_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Epilepsy is quite a common\ndisorder. It affects about 1% of\nthe population, or about 3 million\npeople in the U.S. The first approach\nto treating it is to use medication,\nbut about a third of those people\nstill have seizures despite the best\nmedical therapy.", "semantic_text": "Epilepsy is quite a common disorder. It affects about 1% of the population, or about 3 million people in the U.S. The first approach to treating it is to use medication, but about a third of those people still have seizures despite the best medical therapy.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0006_geometry", "bbox": [100, 1073, 408, 1273], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0006"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_74/hybrid/real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021/page_0015/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021_15_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Having epilepsy can be frustrating,\nespecially for someone who feels\nlike they've made no progress\ncontrolling it. But there's a lot\nof support out there, and groups\nare constantly working on new\ntreatments. Don't be shy about\nreaching out to see what other\noptions are available.", "semantic_text": "Having epilepsy can be frustrating, especially for someone who feels like they've made no progress controlling it. But there's a lot of support out there, and groups are constantly working on new treatments. Don't be shy about reaching out to see what other options are available.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [100, 1274, 404, 1498], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_74/hybrid/real_069_batch_64_NIHMLPSummer2021/page_0015/decisions.json"}
